OL,3,GNEWSAPremier League stability and
OL,4,AEuropean dreams: Ashton on his Ipswich
OL,5,Aplan
OL,6,
OL,7,FMark Ashton, Ipswich Town's chairman
OL,8,Fand chief executive, has stated the
OL,9,Fclub's ambition to stabilise in the
OL,10,FPremier League and aim for Europe,
OL,11,Famong a range of topics discussed in an
OL,12,Finterview with BBC Radio Suffolk.
OL,14,FSince taking the role in 2021, Ashton
OL,15,Fhas presided over a period of
OL,16,Fexceptional success on and off the
OL,17,Fpitch, including Town twice being
OL,18,Fpromoted to the top flight.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
