OL,3,GNEWSAPremier League stability and
OL,4,AEuropean dreams: Ashton on his Ipswich
OL,5,Aplan
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn a feature interview, available on
OL,8,FBBC Sounds, he discussed the club's
OL,9,Ftransfer strategy, the desire of its
OL,10,Finvestors and their shared vision for
OL,11,Fthe future.
OL,13,FThe Tractor Boys earned their third
OL,14,Fpromotion in five seasons in May,
OL,15,Fsealing an immediate return to the top
OL,16,Fflight after relegation in 2024-25.
OL,23,APub: 31-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
